<title>USA: Chief Auto Parts issues $130 mln eight-year debt.</title>
<headline>Chief Auto Parts issues $130 mln eight-year debt.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue from</p>
<p>Chief Auto Parts Inc was priced on Thursday, according to lead</p>
<p>manager Credit Suisse First Boston.</p>
<p>Dallas-based Chief Auto Parts is a retail automotive parts</p>
<p>supplier.</p>
<p>The issue was increased in size by $5 million.</p>
<p>BORROWER CHIEF AUTO PARTS INC</p>
<p>AMT $130 MLN	 COUPON 10-1/2 PCT MATURITY 5/15/2005</p>
<p>TYPE SNR NOTES     ISS PRICE 100.00  FIRST PAY DATE 11/15/97</p>
<p>LAST MOODY'S B2    YIELD 10-1/2 PCT  PAY FREQ SEMI-ANNUAL</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P SINGLE-B  SPREAD 381 BPS    CALLABLE NON-CALL FOUR</p>
<p>NOTES: Three-year equity call for $46.8 million at 110.50.</p>
<p>: Priced over an eight-year interpolated Treasury. ((--U.S. Corporate Bond Unit, 212 859-1672))</p>
